{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 165100, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111088, "uid": 92835, "type": 4, "title": "DC未来更新", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1660725384, "updated_at": 1689229496, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1695221434, "last_at": 1695221434, "comment_count": 35, "status": 1, "summary": "23年7月更新最多可现实两个天子，也可显示温泉皮天子和物品栏最大扩展到1000。Raid相关：取消1~29级车，现在只有30级车，偶尔会出现“史莱姆王”和“隐藏Boss”。“隐藏Boss”拥有更多的血", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1384/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/700299.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1385/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/806518.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1154/1069/92835/2023/3/27/448749.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 19, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 90966, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 165100, "content": "<div><div><br></div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">23年7月更新</span></div></div></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1384\" data-height=\"2475\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1384/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/700299.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1384/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/700299.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 536px;\"><img data-width=\"1385\" data-height=\"2475\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1385/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/806518.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1385/h_2475/1069/92835/2023/6/13/806518.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:300px;height:536px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">最多可现实两个天子，也可显示温泉皮</div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;\">天子和物品栏最大扩展到1000。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;\">Raid相关：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:20px;\">取消1~29级车，现在只有30级车，偶尔会出现“史莱姆王”和“隐藏Boss”。“隐藏Boss”拥有更多的血量和属性，奖励也更丰厚，具体信息等待详细更新。</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">2月更<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">23年2月更</span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">23年4月更新</span></div></div></div><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">对策魂卡新增保底任务，普通魂卡和闪魂卡双保底</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1154\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1154/1069/92835/2023/3/27/448749.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1154/1069/92835/2023/3/27/448749.png\" style=\"height: 288px; width: 400px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">按钮位置变动</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1401\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1401/1069/92835/2023/3/27/568038.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1401/1069/92835/2023/3/27/568038.png\" style=\"height: 350px; width: 400px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">队长Buff显示方式修改</div><div class=\"div-img\">\n          <div class=\"selectItem img-group-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-id=\"img-1682577457823\">\n              <div class=\"mask\"></div>\n              <div class=\"swiper-container gallery-top\">\n                  <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                      <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1108/1069/92835/2023/3/27/652346.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1108\">\n                      </div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1252/1069/92835/2023/3/27/770378.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1252\">\n                      </div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_2441/1069/92835/2023/3/27/647248.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"2441\">\n                      </div>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"swiper-container gallery-thumbs\">\n                  <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                      <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1108/1069/92835/2023/3/27/652346.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1108\">\n                      </div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_1252/1069/92835/2023/3/27/770378.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"1252\">\n                      </div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                          <img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1600/h_2441/1069/92835/2023/3/27/647248.png\" alt=\"\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"2441\">\n                      </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"button-next\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"button-prev\"></div>\n              </div>\n          </div><br></div></div></span></div><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">23年3月更新</span></div></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"593\" data-height=\"924\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_924/1069/92835/2023/1/23/570350.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_924/1069/92835/2023/1/23/570350.png\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 400px;\"><img data-width=\"593\" data-height=\"924\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_924/1069/92835/2023/1/23/721456.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_924/1069/92835/2023/1/23/721456.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:256px;height:400px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">更新星云4</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1098\" data-height=\"1106\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1098/h_1106/1069/92835/2023/1/23/61023.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1098/h_1106/1069/92835/2023/1/23/61023.png\" style=\"width: 496px; height: 500px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">更新玩偶图鉴Buff</span></span></div><br></div><div></div><div><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">23年2月更新</span></div></div></div>温泉可一键收取温泉币，一键泡温泉。<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">23年1月更新</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1. 更新Raid一键收车功能，一次性最多收10车。</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">（</span>失败的车和史莱姆都不在一键收车的收车范围内。<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">）</span><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1662\" data-height=\"1346\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1662/h_1346/1069/92835/2023/0/4/631612.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1662/h_1346/1069/92835/2023/0/4/631612.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2. 更新图鉴筛选功能（可以通过buff筛选了，很方便）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1666\" data-height=\"1000\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1666/h_1000/1069/92835/2023/0/4/654645.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1666/h_1000/1069/92835/2023/0/4/654645.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3. 更新皮肤图鉴（图鉴页面新增第五个Tab，专门显示皮肤，就因为这个功能有多少收集强迫症佬要被迫氪金补满图鉴啊）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1664\" data-height=\"1498\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1664/h_1498/1069/92835/2023/0/4/691932.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1664/h_1498/1069/92835/2023/0/4/691932.png\"></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">12月更新</span></span></span></span></div></div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">12月更新地狱地铁扫荡。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Raid一键收车功能。（鸽了，1月更新）</span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">探险新增24小时选项</span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">和一键领取探险奖励。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">12月水Raid是嫦娥改技能。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"952\" data-height=\"572\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_952/h_572/1069/92835/2022/9/14/307130.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_952/h_572/1069/92835/2022/9/14/307130.png\" style=\"\"></div></span></span></span></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">10月14日</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">11月Race模式回归。</span><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oA411i74k/?is_story_h5=false&amp;p=1&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=823f7bc3-30e5-43f1-87c3-7ec42eb28471&amp;share_source=QQ&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1665721136&amp;unique_k=rqFCtAa&amp;vd_source=850c1431ca2279bd11914e9e5cc3b870\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">老版本Race模式视频</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1600\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/92835/2022/9/14/973980.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/92835/2022/9/14/973980.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 666px;\"></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">23年上半年</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">温泉更新硫磺温泉</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">主屏幕优化（大改动）</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">主屏看板娘新增温泉效果</span>（应该是看板显示多个天子，享受免费泡温泉效果）</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"622\" data-height=\"320\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_622/h_320/1069/92835/2022/9/14/46582.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_622/h_320/1069/92835/2022/9/14/46582.png\"></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">8月18日</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div></div><span style=\"\"></span><br><div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">众所周知，DC一般不更新客户端并且还是如果不更新就不能再继续玩的版本更新，除非新增大型的活动或系统，比如去年IOS<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">更新</span>版本后的星云系统，玩偶系统。先看下图1。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">图二是DC 2021年底和2022年开发计划，现在未上线的最大的坑就是世界Boss爆裂和新赛季内容了。这次更新应该与其相关，我推测是WB爆裂模式的上线，因为最近半年，策划一直在补充WB角色并且在大幅度的降低斩车的门槛，比如：Raid前一周出对应Raid队的发带池子。预计出的时间应该是周年庆或周年庆后。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">然后就是减负功能：扫荡。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">现在游戏的扫荡功能覆盖的面越来越广，8.18更新地下城日常扫荡。目前未上线扫荡功能的地方还有：皮肤塔，翻牌，地狱地铁，Raid？。翻牌扫荡的入口已经空出来了（观察仔细的应该看出来了），开放扫荡按钮只是时间问题，那么问题来了，如果翻牌可以扫荡，那么这个活动不就是点一下就完成吗，其他时间就是长草？所以我推测翻牌出扫荡之日，就是新赛季或者新活动开启之时，弥补翻牌活动扫荡化之后的空缺。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">（预言成功，9.15更新翻牌扫荡）</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1070\" data-height=\"1472\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1070/h_1472/1069/92835/2022/7/17/245771.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1070/h_1472/1069/92835/2022/7/17/245771.png\" style=\"height: 344.618px; width: 250.508px;\"><img data-width=\"880\" data-height=\"827\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_880/h_827/1069/92835/2022/7/17/134758.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_880/h_827/1069/92835/2022/7/17/134758.PNG\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; height: 344.889px; width: 366.992px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9月底周年庆，具体活动还没出。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">十月中旬出新联动，联动游戏《罪恶装备》。<span style=\"\"><br style=\"\">日历图中联动与翻牌同时进行，暗示翻牌要出扫荡了？新的游戏内容可能将替代翻牌在游戏中的时间周期。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"740\" data-height=\"462\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_462/1069/92835/2022/8/29/815259.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_740/h_462/1069/92835/2022/8/29/815259.png\"></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"500\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_750/h_500/1069/92835/2022/8/29/791435.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_750/h_500/1069/92835/2022/8/29/791435.png\"></div></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"1471\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_750/h_1471/1069/92835/2022/8/29/258353.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_750/h_1471/1069/92835/2022/8/29/258353.jpg\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">游戏**内容</span></div></div><br><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/67699.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/67699.png\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/782997.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/782997.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/865677.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/865677.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/772757.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/772757.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">前三个大家应该熟悉，是星云123的门票，而第四个还没有在游戏内实装但是包内已经有的，是星云4的门票。但是没有星云5的门票。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/767190.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/767190.png\" style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/116495.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/116495.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:60px;height:60px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/135476.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/135476.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:60px;height:60px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/203015.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/203015.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:60px;height:60px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/516113.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/516113.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:60px;height:60px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/357883.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/357883.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:60px;height:60px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">这个游戏内已经实装的大家已经知道了，是彩附魔石和新装备制作材料。那下面这些呢，注意！种类是3钟，每种6个不是5个。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">疑似彩色附魔石，装备制作材料废案。但有个问题，如果是废案，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">直接取最高级的图即可，为什么要改变颜色？之前的附魔石和现在的颜色是保持统一的，直接取红蓝绿即可，为什么设计下面图标的时候颜色变了。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/271840.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/271840.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/775084.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/775084.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/499717.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/499717.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/125696.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/125696.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/967207.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/92835/2022/7/17/967207.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//